<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>I smite upon my troubled breast,</l><l>With deep and conscious guilt oppressed;</l><l>Christ and His cross my only plea:</l><l>O God, be merciful to me!</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Far off I stand with tearful eyes,</l><l>Nor dare uplift them to the skies;</l><l>But Thou dost all my anguish see,</l><l>O God, be merciful to me!</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>With alms, or deeds that I have done,</l><l>Not one sin’s pardon can be won;</l><l>To Calvary alone I flee;</l><l>O God, be merciful to me!</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>And when redeemed from sin and hell,</l><l>With all the ransomed throng I dwell,</l><l>My raptured song shall ever be,</l><l>God has been merciful to me!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
